{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 5380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319, "text": "Previously on Night Court. You ought to\nknow about it. New York Board of"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5380, "text": "Education."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 9860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7200, "text": "Yeah, they were computerizing their\nrecords and discovered you."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 14460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10240, "text": "Received an incomplete in ninth grade\nAmerican history which invalidates your"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 15460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14460, "text": "high school diploma."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 17700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15820, "text": "Huh, how do you like that? I'm a\ndropout."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 23520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19080, "text": "I have to take a test? Yeah. In ninth\ngrade history? Mm -hmm. Oh, man, I feel"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 24520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23520, "text": "zit coming on."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 29860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26140, "text": "Don't worry, sir. The board has set up a\ntutor to make sure you pass."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 31280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30240, "text": "She's on her way over."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 33680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31960, "text": "My name is Miss Crombie."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 35840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34460, "text": "I am a history tutor."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 38080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37080, "text": "Donna called."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 42520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38360, "text": "Again? Who is this woman? I have no\nidea. I checked my computer at home. You"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 46380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42520, "text": "know, strangely enough, I've never had a\nDonna. Two Dagmars, a Dana, a Dana, but"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 47380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46380, "text": "no Donna."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 50200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48040, "text": "You mean like Donna of a thousand\nmessages, Donna?"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 52380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50880, "text": "Do we know each other from somewhere?"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 53700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52620, "text": "I would hope so, Dan."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 55380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54380, "text": "I'm your baby sister."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 61560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58140, "text": "I had a business meeting this evening.\nWhy don't I cancel it? Take you to"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 64420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61560, "text": "dinner. I know this great little\nFilipino -Cajun place."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 67860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66000, "text": "No, I wouldn't feel right about it."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 71900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 68200, "text": "We haven't seen each other in 20 years.\nWhat is one more night? Go to your"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 72900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71900, "text": "meeting."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 74360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73100, "text": "Bull! Yep."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 76760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75760, "text": "Do me a favor."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 79620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76880, "text": "Take care of my little sister. Show her\naround town. See the sights."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 81280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80280, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 86510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 84450, "text": "Please tell me you didn't sleep\ntogether."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 88450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87450, "text": "Heavens, no."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 91390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90130, "text": "We only had sex."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 97310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94770, "text": "No, no, no. Two S's in assault, Missy."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 104930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98390, "text": "I saw that, Harold. Back to your own\nwork. You have a test this evening."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 106610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105530, "text": "Yes, Miss Crombie."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 109250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107830, "text": "Your battle axe."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 113500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111340, "text": "In the old days, I would have hit her\nwith a spitball."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 114880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113880, "text": "You're a pea shooter."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 116200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115200, "text": "You're a crossbow."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 119660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 118140, "text": "I went to a tough school."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 122060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 121060, "text": "I'll pass."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 123320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122320, "text": "Thank you, Bull."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 127020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126020, "text": "Hi,"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 128360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 127260, "text": "Bull. How you doing?"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 133520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129280, "text": "My life has become a torturous,\nexcruciatingly cruel joke with no one in"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 134580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133520, "text": "to my cycle of despair."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 135940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134940, "text": "Thanks for asking."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 140320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137300, "text": "Bull, we've been worried about you. You\nhaven't eaten in a week."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 146960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140920, "text": "I can eat, not as long as Dan hates me.\nI got your favorite, frosted neon"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 151820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146960, "text": "nuggets. Mmm, cereal that glows in the\ndark, young man."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 154360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152700, "text": "I won't eat. Don't ask me."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 156680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155000, "text": "Come on, Bull, it's over."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 158540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 156940, "text": "Dan's not one to hold a grudge."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 161000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 159740, "text": "Hello, Dan. Hey, Dan."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 162320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 161320, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 216480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215480, "text": "Um, 1876."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 222560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217540, "text": "1876, okay. In 1976, I graduated from\nlaw school. I was the graduate."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 227160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222820, "text": "Dustin Hoffman was the graduate, and he\nalso played that Indian guy in Little"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 228960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227160, "text": "Big Man Custer's Last Dance."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 230820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229820, "text": "That's right."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 234080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232340, "text": "Long way to get there, but you made it."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 236880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235280, "text": "Looks like you got a good system."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 241960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237140, "text": "Yeah, see, if I associate each date with\na key Dustin Hoffman movie, then the"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 242960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241960, "text": "rest of it falls into place."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 244960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243820, "text": "Try another one. Okay."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 247640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246640, "text": "1914."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 254360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247920, "text": "1914. 19 plus 14 is 33. I was 33 when I\nsaw Tootsie, and Tootsie Dustin Hoffman"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 257360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254360, "text": "played a woman. He had trouble getting\ninto a girdle battle of the bulge."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 264260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261779, "text": "Nope. Panama Canal opened."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 268060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264560, "text": "Right. Panama Water Rain Man. What was I\nthinking?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 271480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269240, "text": "Looks like your system's got a few\nflaws."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 275540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272320, "text": "Mac, my entire career hinges on this\ntest."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 278680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276640, "text": "Desperate times call for desperate\nmeasures."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 281380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280100, "text": "I'm thinking of cheating."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 286600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281760, "text": "Oh, now, come on, sir. Now, you are\nbigger than that. Oh, no, I'm not. I"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 287600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286600, "text": "plan."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 291080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287760, "text": "I'm going to fill this clear pen with\ntiny little crib notes."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 296040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291380, "text": "Then, if Crombie the zombie looks my\nway, I put it in my mouth and pretend to"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 297900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296040, "text": "pondering. Sir."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 299720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298540, "text": "Right, dumb idea."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 302000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300560, "text": "Okay, give me another one. Okay."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 308160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303500, "text": "1862, the South defeats the North in the\nBattle of... Bull?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 310380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308500, "text": "Good for you, sir. Now, Bull what?"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 311860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310740, "text": "No, Mac, look."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 313200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312200, "text": "Bull's here."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 316920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313800, "text": "And he has the word Nem imprinted on his\nforehead."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 321400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317280, "text": "That's men backwards. I found him\nbeating his head against the door to the"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 323100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 322100, "text": "I'm scum."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 324780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323420, "text": "I don't deserve to live."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 327820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325560, "text": "Bull, don't be so hard on yourself."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 329360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328280, "text": "It's all my fault."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 331470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329790, "text": "I took advantage of Dan's little sister."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 334510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331770, "text": "Now, I know you, and I know you wouldn't\nhave done that."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 338730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 334830, "text": "Sit down and just tell us what really\nhappened that night."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 343010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340910, "text": "Well, we went down to the fish market."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 345090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343890, "text": "It was magic time."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 347170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345570, "text": "They'd just begun to unload the tuna."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 349950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348250, "text": "That would sweep me off my feet."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 354810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350930, "text": "Yeah, Donna felt the same way, too,\nbecause she slipped on a mackerel and"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 355810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354810, "text": "the heel off her shoe."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 357850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356570, "text": "So we went back to her hotel."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 362590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359210, "text": "I was writing a letter to Mom on the\ncomplimentary hotel stationery when the"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 363590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362590, "text": "bedroom door opened."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 368030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364210, "text": "There she stood in a slinky nightgown\nholding two glasses of champagne."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 370330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369330, "text": "What did you say?"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 372670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370590, "text": "Nothing. What did she say?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 374630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373090, "text": "Hey, Thaler, want to do the hornpipe?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 381410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376750, "text": "Well, you didn't do anything wrong. You\nhave nothing to blame yourself for."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 383730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382610, "text": "Are you sure?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 385430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384430, "text": "I'm a judge."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 386570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385570, "text": "I know guilt."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 388560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387240, "text": "Stop punishing yourself."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 392340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391340, "text": "Thanks, Harry."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 397800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396800, "text": "Hear that, guys?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 400080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398060, "text": "You get to go back to the leech farm\ntonight."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 404320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403320, "text": "What's next, Matt?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 405760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404560, "text": "The file's on its way, sir."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 407980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406720, "text": "Another message from your sister."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 412340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410920, "text": "I'll file it with the rest of them."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 419960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 418960, "text": "Go talk to him."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 422200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421200, "text": "He looks busy."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 423740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422740, "text": "Plus, he hates me."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 428140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424740, "text": "He's not busy. He's doing a crossword\npuzzle. Go talk to him and make up."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 437060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435240, "text": "Dan, I want to be friends again."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 440620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438700, "text": "Full of the word meaning sewage."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 443900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442900, "text": "Of course."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 451840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450700, "text": "really being rotten to Bull."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 455580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452240, "text": "We all know what happened. Your sister\nasked him to do the corn pipe."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 460660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459660, "text": "Corn pipe."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 466300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463100, "text": "That's not the point. I mean, Bull could\nhave put a bucket of ice down his pants"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 467640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466300, "text": "and graciously said goodnight."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 471240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 469260, "text": "Okay, study hall's over. Call it, Max."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 473880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471540, "text": "Yes, sir. People versus Ketover and\nAustin."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 478140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474640, "text": "Yes, sir. It seems as though we have\nhere a donut shop melee."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 483580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478660, "text": "It's all his fault. Today was our grand\nopening till he walked out. Your Honor,"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 488660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483700, "text": "apparently Mr. Austin paid Mr. Ketover's\ntuition to the Donut Academy so that"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 491880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 488660, "text": "they could open a franchise together.\nSee, we had a deal, Your Honor. I supply"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 493920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491880, "text": "the capital, he supplies the know -how."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 495700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494140, "text": "I hate donuts!"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 498600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497020, "text": "Just say so early!"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 503620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499240, "text": "Look, Irwin, it's one thing to be out\nfront schmoozing with the cops and"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 506220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503620, "text": "refilling the napkins. That's glamorous."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 511720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507360, "text": "I'm the one who's trapped in a hot,\nsweaty kitchen up to my tacos and jelly"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 516120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511720, "text": "donuts. I couldn't take it anymore,\nIrwin. I had to get out. With the"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 519039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516120, "text": "that I paid for, you owe me."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 524520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520539, "text": "I'm a little down. Can anyone make any\nsense out of this?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 526020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525020, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 527080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526080, "text": "I can."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 533330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527420, "text": "This is about... The foundation on which\nfriendships are built. There is no"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 538810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533330, "text": "greater honor than to have the trust of\na friend. And no greater disgrace than"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 540530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538810, "text": "to betray that trust."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 544830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 542190, "text": "Gee, Counselor, aren't we a little over\nthe top?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 546510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545510, "text": "I get it."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 548330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546890, "text": "He's talking about me."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 550790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549470, "text": "Bingo, Bonzo."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 562590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558350, "text": "Nice job, Fielding. You two split a $100\nfine and pay the damages."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 564590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563170, "text": "Dan, my office."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 565810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564810, "text": "Now."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 570310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566410, "text": "No chance to talk with your little\nplaymates. You need to study, and from"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 571550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570310, "text": "hear, you'll need every minute."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 573710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571790, "text": "But... It's all right. It's all right.\nGo ahead. Do your homework."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 576770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574090, "text": "If I can't handle these two babies, I'm\nnot fit to be a mother."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 578250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 577250, "text": "Move it, Harold."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 581590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580090, "text": "Dan, hallway, now."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 583110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582050, "text": "What if I say no?"}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 586330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583890, "text": "What if I say I'll pull your lips over\nyour head?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 590430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589390, "text": "What if I say what's keeping you?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 602690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 596090, "text": "Look at you two."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 609430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604710, "text": "Dan, I bet if you were to apologize to\nBull, he just might apologize to you and"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 611250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609430, "text": "you two could go back to being good\nfriends again."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 613270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611810, "text": "Listen, little Mary Sunshine."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 616530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614650, "text": "It's not like he broke my Lincoln logs."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 618760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617070, "text": "He bopped. my sister."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 621300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620160, "text": "I didn't mean to."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 623300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 622240, "text": "It was an accident."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 625380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624380, "text": "Uh -uh."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 626880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625440, "text": "Chernobyl was an accident."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 630700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627680, "text": "This was the attack of the horny mutant\nninja bailiff."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 634240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633060, "text": "Come on, guys."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 636300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634440, "text": "Let's turn those frowns upside down."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 639540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637900, "text": "I'd do anything to make this right."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 642620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640320, "text": "I'd run the marathon with broken glass\nin my sneakers."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 647320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644580, "text": "I'd stand in front of a number four bus\ncovered in crazy glue."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 652310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649210, "text": "I removed my own liver and donated it to\nscience in your name."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 657090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653770, "text": "Gee, Dan, it seems that Bull is willing\nto go more than halfway."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 661930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660930, "text": "Well, I'm not."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 666670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665010, "text": "There's only one thing left to do."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 668650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667570, "text": "The honorable thing."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 671930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670010, "text": "Well, I hope you're not going to do\nanything rash."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 674710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672330, "text": "Don't be silly. I'm going to marry Dan's\nsister. Bye."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 687000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684080, "text": "The judge is stalling because he doesn't\nwant to take this test."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 691900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 687280, "text": "Oh, no, no, no. I'm sure he's making an\nimportant legal point. I mean, he never"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 692900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691900, "text": "stalls."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 700180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693420, "text": "And playing the three -card Monty on\nNinth Avenue. Not any random street in"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 706240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700180, "text": "huge city, but a boulevard teeming with\nimpressionable youth, children of all"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 710240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706240, "text": "races and creeds. Your Honor, could you\nget on with it, please? I'd like to see"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 711560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710240, "text": "my baby before he reaches puberty."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 714820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713520, "text": "It hasn't been going on that long."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 718640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715400, "text": "Your Honor, I've lost all feeling in my\nfingers."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 722680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720200, "text": "All right, $200 in five days."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 725940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722940, "text": "What's next, Max? That's it, sir. The\ncupboard's bare. No."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 727180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726180, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 730080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728160, "text": "Well, then let's open the floor to\ndiscussion."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 731560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730560, "text": "Any questions?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 733120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732120, "text": "Just one."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 737020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733700, "text": "When are you going to quit stalling and\ntake this test?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 738960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737960, "text": "Right now."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 743130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740460, "text": "That's it. Zero hours. Pray for me."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 745150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743770, "text": "Pray there's no wine in the men's room."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 748790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747230, "text": "Well, good luck, sir."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 750190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749190, "text": "Thank you, Mac."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 754290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753290, "text": "What are these?"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 756110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754750, "text": "Cheat sheets, just in case."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 759410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 757210, "text": "I thought you said I was too big for\nthese."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 760650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 759650, "text": "You may be, but I'm not."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 763130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761390, "text": "You know I hate cheating."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 765390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763490, "text": "But if you fail that test, you're out of\nhere."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 769710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765770, "text": "And I'm stuck with a new judge. And I'm\ntoo old to train anybody else. You think"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 773890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769710, "text": "I want to crash, don't you? You're\nbigger than the stock market in 19..."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 776010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774330, "text": "Ha! I don't need those."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 777490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776490, "text": "Huh."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 779350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778270, "text": "Uh, Mac? Yeah?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 781590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779730, "text": "Stock market crash was in 1929."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 783110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782110, "text": "I know."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 786810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 784590, "text": "You think the new judge might want to\npaint?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 791990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789630, "text": "Where the hell have you been? You missed\nthe whole session."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 793390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792250, "text": "I had some shopping to do."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 797530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794990, "text": "That better be my bailiff appreciation\nweek gift."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 799110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798090, "text": "It isn't."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 803630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799650, "text": "Then it better not be for Dan's sister,\nthat little... Watch it, Roz, that the"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 804389, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803630, "text": "future Mrs."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 805830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804390, "text": "Bull Shannon you're about to slam."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 808290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807290, "text": "Sorry."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 811710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808910, "text": "So, how much did you spend on the little\ndarling?"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 813330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812330, "text": "Well, let's see."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 815850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814450, "text": "$145 ,000."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 820630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817510, "text": "This rock better be the size of\nWisconsin or you've been taken."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 823120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822120, "text": "You've been taken."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 827780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824020, "text": "Well, it wasn't just the ring. I also\nbought some personalized stationery, a"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 831660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827780, "text": "crystal pattern, a dining room set, a\nstation wagon, and a cute little co -op"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 832660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831660, "text": "the east side."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 834980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833640, "text": "Where'd you get that kind of money?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 836260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 835260, "text": "I sold some blood."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 838160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837100, "text": "I'm a very rare type."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 844620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840740, "text": "Well, will you listen to yourself? If\nyou go through with this, you'll be"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 845620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844620, "text": "brother -in -law."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 847320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845940, "text": "Dan will use you."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 851850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847610, "text": "Dan will humiliate you. Dan will borrow\nmoney from you."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 854810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852550, "text": "So my life won't change that much except\nfor the sex."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 860830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859310, "text": "Who do you love her?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 862310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861090, "text": "I don't even know her."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 864870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862850, "text": "But I gave my word and I intend to keep\nit."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 870770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866050, "text": "Well, before you go through with this,\nremember what my grandfather used to"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 873650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870770, "text": "me. To thine own self be true."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 875450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874450, "text": "That's Hamlet."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 879840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876300, "text": "I meant what I said, and I said what I\nmeant. An elephant's faithful 100%."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 880840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879840, "text": "That's Horton."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 888220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885140, "text": "You've worked very hard, Harold, and for\nthat you should be commended."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 891500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888820, "text": "And I'm sure you would do very well on\nthe exam."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 892760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891760, "text": "No doubt about it."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 894940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893220, "text": "If you had to take the exam."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 898640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895900, "text": "What do you mean, if? No exam, no\ndiploma, right?"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 900160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899160, "text": "Not necessarily."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 903440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900880, "text": "There are alternatives to the exam."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 905020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904020, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 911180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906080, "text": "I'm saying... I find you very\nattractive."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 918300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917300, "text": "Hi,"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 920820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919820, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 926080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922760, "text": "Look, I know you don't want to talk to\nme, but I'm leaving tomorrow, and I"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 927120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926080, "text": "wanted to say goodbye."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 931280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929760, "text": "Incidentally, I got the job I was after."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 933380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 932080, "text": "I'm the new senior VP."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 935470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934160, "text": "Huzzah! Hurrah."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 937010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936010, "text": "Congratulations."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 941570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937730, "text": "I guess even a poor shoeless girl from\nthe bayou can make it in the big city."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 943650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941950, "text": "Apparently, you'll make it with anyone."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 947110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945670, "text": "What are you implying?"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 952750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947490, "text": "I'm implying that you're a little loose\nwith the caboose, a little easy with the"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 954770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952750, "text": "sleazy, a little lax in the slacks."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 958610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956670, "text": "So you're saying I'm a slut?"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 961230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959870, "text": "I'm saying you're a disappointment."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 965380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962910, "text": "Who are you to say that I'm... I'm a\ndisappointment."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 967660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965580, "text": "Hey, I am your big brother. I'll say\nwhat I want."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 971220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968100, "text": "Dan, after having been out of my life\nfor the last 20 years, you do not have"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 972440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971220, "text": "right to say squat."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 981360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976920, "text": "Well, we're just disappointed with\neverything and everybody around here,"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 983720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981360, "text": "we? Roz, please keep your nose out of my\nfamily affairs."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 986780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984420, "text": "I could care less about you and Scarlett\nO 'Hara."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 990440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988980, "text": "It's what you're doing to Bull."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 993060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 991180, "text": "What I'm doing to Bull? Wait a second."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 997780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993440, "text": "I asked him to show my sister the big\napple, not the big apple."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1003640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001580, "text": "Stan, it takes two to tangle."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1006680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003840, "text": "All right, so she's as guilty as he is.\nThat doesn't make it right."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1010640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007640, "text": "Look, you liked her when she first came\nhere, right? Yeah. Why?"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1013200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011780, "text": "Because she reminded me of me."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1016160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013520, "text": "And all of a sudden, you didn't like\nher."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1017500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016500, "text": "Why?"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1019240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017820, "text": "Because she reminded me of me."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1021160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020100, "text": "There, I said it. Happy?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1022780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021780, "text": "Not at all."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1023910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022910, "text": "You?"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1025869, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024869, "text": "Miserable."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1027970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026089, "text": "Dan, your problem's not with your\nsister."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1029950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1028550, "text": "Your problem's with you."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1037250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034910, "text": "I called for a cab 15 minutes ago."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1038930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037930, "text": "Where is it?"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1041810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040609, "text": "What did you call me?"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1047170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045950, "text": "I hate this city."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1049250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1047770, "text": "Ah, come on, it's not that bad."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1051250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049710, "text": "Of course, I don't have to look at it."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1070240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066320, "text": "I just came by to congratulate you on\nyour new job. I'm sure you worked very"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1071240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070240, "text": "hard and deserve it."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1084000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077860, "text": "Look, I said a lot of stupid and felting\nthings back there, and I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1088440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085820, "text": "I'm the last person in the world to be\ngiving libido lectures to anyone."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1092620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089860, "text": "And if you don't forgive me, I'll\nunderstand completely."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1095320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094320, "text": "Forgive me?"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1100140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099139, "text": "Fine. I understand."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1101840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100840, "text": "I'm an adult."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1104660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101940, "text": "I'm going to deal with this in an adult\nmanner."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1109120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105260, "text": "Well, if you'll excuse me, I'm going to\ngo to the roof now and hurl myself to"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1110120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109120, "text": "the street below."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1112420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111420, "text": "Bye, Donna."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1113760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112760, "text": "Nice seeing you."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1120680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117460, "text": "If anyone has a car parked outside, I\nsuggest you move it."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1130050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127590, "text": "I can be stopped. I'm willing to be\nstopped."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1134290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133290, "text": "Gotcha."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1138230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137230, "text": "Stop, Dan."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1143470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139950, "text": "You saved my life."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1145070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143910, "text": "You weren't going to jump."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1146309, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145330, "text": "How do you know that?"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1148950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146310, "text": "Because I pulled the same routine on Mom\nand Daddy when I was 10."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1151350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149450, "text": "They wouldn't buy me Backwoods Barbie."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1157260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156140, "text": "Let's run in our gene pool."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1163100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158660, "text": "Look, Donna, when you bounced back into\nmy life last week, I didn't know what to"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1165320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163100, "text": "think, what to say, what to do."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1167740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166040, "text": "So I decided to act like a big brother."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1170360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168620, "text": "Something I obviously know nothing\nabout."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1173140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172060, "text": "But something I do know."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1180380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175360, "text": "There's a big hole in my life, and\nhaving you around filled it."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1183980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182200, "text": "A hole in your life?"}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1185400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184400, "text": "You?"}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1190760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186540, "text": "$700 suits, influential friends, nice\ncars, bonded teeth."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1195140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193500, "text": "I thought you had it all."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1197200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195960, "text": "Believe it or not, I don't."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1201240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197580, "text": "In the friends department, I'm rather\ndeficient."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1205440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202140, "text": "But you wrote Mama that you'd spent\nChristmas with Schwarzenegger. I did."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1207360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205780, "text": "I sat through his movie four times."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1214380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209780, "text": "Look, we've lost a lot over the last 20\nyears. I don't want to lose any more."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1217040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215880, "text": "I want to get to know you."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1223040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219600, "text": "And I don't want to have to spend next\nChristmas with Arnold."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1230380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228180, "text": "Well, this Christmas I'm supposed to go\nto Bermuda."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1234360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232020, "text": "But I could cancel."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1237900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236760, "text": "You'd come back here for Christmas?"}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1240100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238680, "text": "We could talk about it."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1241800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240800, "text": "Over dinner?"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1243300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242300, "text": "Sounds good."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1245160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244160, "text": "Oh, God."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1251000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249580, "text": "Get your mitts off my woman."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1254980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253420, "text": "Bull, what are you doing?"}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1256560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255400, "text": "The honorable thing."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1261140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259940, "text": "Donna, will you marry me?"}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1269100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264480, "text": "I promise to honor and obey in sickness\nand in health and to never eat"}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1270100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269100, "text": "crustaceans in bed."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1273200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271780, "text": "Bull, get up."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1276740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275260, "text": "You're a swell guy and..."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1281450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277130, "text": "I'm very sorry for putting you through\nall of this, and I don't deserve you as"}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1282450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281450, "text": "friend."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1284870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282490, "text": "But you don't have to marry my sister,\nbig fella."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1288230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286750, "text": "Hmm. Mrs."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1289530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288450, "text": "Bull Shannon."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1291930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290890, "text": "What are you, nuts?"}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1300170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295370, "text": "I'm sorry, Bull. I am very flattered.\nBut I'm not ready for marriage."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1301990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1300990, "text": "Whew!"}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1305290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303670, "text": "Well, this worked out really well."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1308560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306060, "text": "I don't have to get married, and I'm way\nahead of my holiday shopping."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1312800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310540, "text": "Dan, will you see the ring I got you for\nChristmas?"}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1316360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315180, "text": "Hey, Harry, how'd it go?"}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1318760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316980, "text": "You're looking at a high school\ngraduate."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1322720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319140, "text": "Well, congratulations, sir. See?"}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1325580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323660, "text": "All that studying paid off."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1330600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326160, "text": "In a way, Miss Crombie put the move on\nher favorite student."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1332240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331180, "text": "She didn't."}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1333880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332880, "text": "She did."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1335400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334200, "text": "You didn't."}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1337190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336190, "text": "I did."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1339150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337650, "text": "I told her to go flunk herself."}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1341050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339570, "text": "I got her to call the Board of\nEducation."}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1344090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341610, "text": "Well, did you take the test? You bet,\nand I passed."}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1345830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344830, "text": "Look at this."}
{"cue": 390, "end_ms": 1346930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345930, "text": "D minus."}
{"cue": 391, "end_ms": 1353310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348350, "text": "And the rest, as they say, is history.\nCome on, let's hit the malt shop. I feel"}
{"cue": 392, "end_ms": 1354189, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353310, "text": "like celebrating."}
{"cue": 393, "end_ms": 1355430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354190, "text": "Oh, great. Oh, yeah, sir."}
{"cue": 394, "end_ms": 1356890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1355890, "text": "One more thing."}
{"cue": 395, "end_ms": 1359390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1357090, "text": "Yeah. This came in the mail today."}
{"cue": 396, "end_ms": 1362570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1361050, "text": "It's from your elementary school."}
